---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal notice: publisher of these German EV grant calculators" description="Legal notice under section 5 DDG and section 18 MStV: who publishes the German EV grant, net price, GHG quota and vehicle tax calculators, who is responsible, who hosts." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information under section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG) for {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Responsible for content (section 18(2) MStV)</h2>
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, address as above, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the site does</h2>
    <p>The site works out the grant for buying or leasing a new electric car under the German funding guideline of 19 May 2026, the price after the grant for individual models, the GHG quota payout and vehicle tax under the Vehicle Tax Act. It is not a service of the Federal Office for Economic Affairs and Export Control (BAFA), a ministry or any other authority, not a car dealer, not a GHG quota provider and not tax or legal advice. Only BAFA decides on the grant, through its grant decision. Methods: <a href={route('method', lang)}>how we calculate</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Values are checked after every change to the guideline, the laws and the official statistics and are tested automatically before each release; we cannot guarantee that they are free of errors. Linked third-party sites are the responsibility of their operators. Please report errors via the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2>
    <p>The grant calculator and the GHG quota calculator may be embedded free of charge by iframe as long as the source link stays visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed a calculator</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Consumer dispute resolution</h2>
    <p>We are neither willing nor obliged to take part in proceedings before a consumer arbitration board. Privacy: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>. Version: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
